Knowledge index
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The VSIX ships resources/knowledge/core.db, the core knowledge index of the
CMSIS Knowledge Base. Its content is derived from the sources listed in
resources/knowledge/SOURCES.md under their licences (Apache License 2.0,
MIT License, BSD 3-Clause License) and from summaries of public GitHub
issues written in our own words. SOURCES.md names every source with its
repository and licence, and carries the copyright lines and licence texts
the MIT and BSD 3-Clause licences require and the NOTICE files of the
Apache-2.0 sources. The index itself is distributed under this extension's
licence terms.
